# Anonymous usage analytics (PostHog). Without a key nothing is loaded or sent.
# In Netlify: Site configuration > Environment variables (the key starts with phc_, it is public by design).
VITE_POSTHOG_KEY=
# EU project: https://eu.i.posthog.com   US project (default): https://us.i.posthog.com
VITE_POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.i.posthog.com
